EPSG Geodetic Parameter Dataset

crates/crs/data/epsg.txt (the EPSG table embedded in whereabouts-crs) and the
EPSG-derived CRS test fixtures in crates/crs/tests/data contain data from the
EPSG Geodetic Parameter Dataset (https://epsg.org), version v12.029, owned by
the International Association of Oil & Gas Producers (IOGP), used under the
EPSG terms of use (https://epsg.org/terms-of-use.html). The data was extracted
from the PROJ database (proj.db, PROJ 9.7.1 / PROJ-data 1.24), reduced to the
fields Whereabouts needs and converted to degrees/metres; it is not presented
as the EPSG Dataset itself. The EPSG Dataset is provided "as is", without
warranty of any kind.

