Esri projection engine definitions

The Esri CRS names (aliases) in crates/crs/data/epsg.txt and the ESRI WKT test
fixtures (esri.prj, esri-* in crates/crs/tests/data) come from Esri's
projection-engine-db-doc (https://github.com/Esri/projection-engine-db-doc),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, as imported into PROJ.

